  "content": "\n\n<h1>希臘摩艾村民結構</h1>\n<p><strong>本模組</strong>&nbsp;將&nbsp;<strong>希臘摩艾村民加入 Minecraft</strong>，生成於&nbsp;<strong>白樺林與繁花森林生態域</strong>，為&nbsp;<strong>原版遊戲</strong>&nbsp;帶來更佳氛圍</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f9ff396632239f23dc4cda543625ba36ca3f9180.jpeg\" alt=\"希臘摩艾村民宣傳圖\"></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Moairium &copy; - 2026</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>備註📝 (Notes)</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>希臘摩艾村民</strong>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<strong>版本 1.20 至 26.1.2</strong>🏷️ <strong>相容</strong></li>\n<li><strong>希臘摩艾村民</strong>&nbsp;在世界生成中新增了&nbsp;<strong>（結構）</strong>🌐</li>\n<li><strong>希臘摩艾村民</strong>&nbsp;與任何&nbsp;<strong>世界生成模組</strong>&nbsp;相容</li>\n<li><strong>不需要</strong>&nbsp;對下載的檔案進行&nbsp;<strong>解壓縮</strong> 🗂️</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>生成🌐 (Generation)</h2>\n<p><strong>若想使用</strong>&nbsp;<strong>指令尋找</strong>&nbsp;它，請輸入：<code>/locate structure moairium:greek_villager_moai</code></p>",
